Enable explicit image pitches for imported host pointers without Linux dma-buf support.

Turnip on Darwin advertises image_drm_format_modifier but deliberately no DMA_BUF
import. Keep the DMA_BUF route gated; enable and track host modifier layouts separately.
The existing driver layout, bounds, format, and allocation checks remain intact.

